Subject: [PATCH] zk9500: add ZKTeco ZK9500 (1b55:0124) optical driver

---
 libfprint/drivers/zk9500.c        | 1125 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 libfprint/fprint-list-udev-hwdb.c |    1 +
 libfprint/meson.build             |    1 +
 meson.build                       |    1 +
